   "text": "Ravensbourne University London - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nRavensbourne University London\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nRavensbourne University is an innovative, industry-focused university located next to the world-famous O2 on the vibrant Greenwich Peninsula. We have a community of approximately 2,600 students and offer practically focused digital media and design courses from undergraduate and postgraduate to professional short course level. Driven by industry standards and supported by the latest high-performance technology, we produce highly employable and enterprising graduates. We have a strong track record in graduate employability and business creation.&nbsp;\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n11/06/2026 08:06\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n26/03/2026 09:06\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £17,000.00\nMin: £16,500.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n8%\n208 of 2,600 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nOIEG (Oxford International Education Group)\nFounded Year\n1962\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nAfghanistan, Cameroon, Sudan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n08/02/2024\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.ish.org.uk/longstay/\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qs0kBkUy6zU\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
